  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "What is the value of \\[ \\begin{gathered} \\log_3 7\\cdot\\log_5 9\\cdot\\log_7 11 \\\\ {}\\cdot\\log_9 13\\cdots\\log_{21} 25\\cdot\\log_{23} 27? \\end{gathered} \\]",
